  "6df684b7-88a2-4de0-baf8-40c2349cc91c"],
 " pass, and so does every larger equidistant set, such as the whole bisector \
when it separates."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"eab2bb64-999f-493f-95d7-c0c6af5365ca"],

