Cell["\<\
As an assertion in a scene. The bisector of 45 and 47 is a plane; the shell \
of radius 1 about 45 separates the points but is not equidistant from them, \
and the scene has no instance:\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"b4df0ddb-d994-4950-861e-57f0e20fb9fa"],

